      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium">
        <span>DPWH Infrastructure Allocation</span>
        <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-slate-700">8-Year Span</span>
